H_4127453">http://www.dh.gov.uk/en/Publicationsandstatistics/Publications/PublicationsPolicyAndGuidance/DH_4127453</ext-link></comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="r6"><label>6</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Department for Environment, Transport and the Regions</collab><source>Supporting people: a new policy and funding framework for support services</source><year>1998</year><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>DETR</publisher-name></element-citation></ref><ref id="r7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Office of the Deputy Prime Minister</collab><source>The NHS and the supporting people strategy: building the links</source><year>2002</year><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>ODPM</publisher-name></element-citation></ref><ref id="r8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Department of Health</collab><source>Partnership in action (new opportunities for joint working between health and social services): a discussion document</source><year>1998</year><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Department of Health</publisher-name><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://site320.theclubuk.com/en/Publicationsandstatistics/Publications/PublicationsPolicyAndGuidance/DH_4008919">http://site320.theclubuk.com/en/Publicationsandstatistics/Publications/PublicationsPolicyAndGuidance/DH_4008919</ext-link></comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="r9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Department of Health</collab><source>HSC 2000/010: Implementation of Health Act partnership arrangements</source><year>2000</year><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Department of Health</publisher-name><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://site320.theclubuk.com/en/Publicationsandstatistics/Lettersandcirculars/Healthservicecirculars/DH_4004753">http://si